  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "totoの投票パターンをまとめて入力する補助ツールです。",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://store.toto-dream.com/dcs/subos/screen/ps01/spsl000/PGSPSL00001MoveSingleVoteSheet.form*",
